      "jev_full": "{\"model\": \"jev-1.14.0\", \"questions\": {\"q0\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [party_statement; Marc Guberti, fool.com; original source Broadcom, stated unknown] Broadcom told investors on its earnings call that it expects its AI chip revenue to double to $115 billion in its fiscal 2027 and then to double again to $230 billion in its fiscal 2028. | quote: Broadcom told investors that it expects its AI chip revenue to double to $115 billion in its fiscal 2027, and then to double yet again to $230 billion in its fiscal 2028.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q1\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [fact; Keithen Drury, fool.com; original source Broadcom, stated 2026-09-02] Broadcom, in the fiscal Q3 results it reported on September 2, 2026, said its AI semiconductor division grew 221% year over year to $16.7 billion, while its overall company growth rate was 86%. Reported by Keithen Drury of fool.com as comparison context against Nvidia's AI accelerator business. | quote: Broadcom reported its fiscal Q3 numbers on Sept. 2, and it noted that its AI semiconductor division grew by 221% year over year to $16.7 billion. Broadcom does other things as a company, so its overall growth rate was 86%, which is still impressive.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q2\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [third_party_view; fool.com (Harsh Chauhan); original source Deloitte, stated unknown] Deloitte estimates the global semiconductor market could be worth $975 billion in calendar 2026, with $500 billion of that coming from sales of AI chips, and that the overall semiconductor market could reach $2 trillion in 2036 even with moderate growth, as cited by fool.com. | quote: Deloitte estimates that the global semiconductor market could be worth $975 billion in 2026, with $500 billion coming from sales of AI chips. Even better, the overall semiconductor market could be worth $2 trillion in 2036, according to Deloitte, even with moderate growth.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q3\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [third_party_view; fool.com (Harsh Chauhan); original source AMD, stated unknown] AMD forecasts that sales of AI accelerator chips could hit $1 trillion in 2030, as cited by fool.com. | quote: Nvidia rival AMD forecasts that sales of AI accelerator chips could hit $1 trillion in 2030.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q4\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [party_statement; Manali Pradhan, fool.com; original source Nvidia, stated unknown] Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang said Nvidia expects revenue to grow about 70% in fiscal 2028, which begins January 31, 2027. Management said the forecast does not reflect the full scope of demand because it is constrained by limited supply of components for its AI platforms. | quote: He said Nvidia expects revenue to grow about 70% in its fiscal 2028, which begins Jan 31, 2027. But management says even that forecast doesn't reflect the full scope of demand for its offerings; it's constrained by the limited supply of components required to build its artificial intelligence (AI) platforms.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q5\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [third_party_view; calcalistech.com; original source calcalistech.com, stated 2026-09-06] Calcalistech estimates Nvidia's fiscal 2027 revenue at about $400 billion, up about 85% from fiscal 2026. | quote: This year, however, revenue is expected to jump to about $400 billion, an increase of about 85% from the previous year.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q6\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source 