red two to three years in advance.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}}, \"state\": \"INCOMING PIECE [party_statement; CNBC / finance.yahoo.com; original source NVIDIA Corporation (CFO Colette Kress), stated 2026-08-26] NVIDIA CFO Colette Kress told investors on August 26, 2026 that fiscal 2028 revenue growth will reach 70%, the company's first-ever year-ahead revenue forecast and far above the 44% average analyst estimate tracked by LSEG. The article says applying that to the roughly $396 billion fiscal 2027 consensus implies fiscal 2028 revenue near $673 billion to $700 billion. | quote: CNBC reported that NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ: NVDA ) CFO Colette Kress told investors on August 26 that fiscal 2028 revenue growth will reach 70%, far above the 44% average analyst estimate tracked by LSEG, marking the company's first-ever year-ahead revenue forecast. Applied to the roughly $396 billion consensus estimate for fiscal 2027, that guidance implies fiscal 2028 revenue near $673 billion to $700 billion.\"}",
