    "jev_full": "{\"model\": \"jev-1.14.0\", \"questions\": {\"q0\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [party_statement; NVIDIA, reported by CNBC; original source NVIDIA, stated unknown] Nvidia rejected SemiAnalysis's report that the Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028, stating, \\\"Our roadmap is intact.\\\" | quote: Nvidia rejected the SemiAnalysis report and said, \\\"Our roadmap is intact.\\\"\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q1\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [third_party_view; SemiAnalysis, reported by CNBC; original source SemiAnalysis, stated Monday] Research firm SemiAnalysis said in a post on Monday that Nvidia's Kyber NVL144 rack architecture — the rack-scale system slated to debut with the Vera Rubin Ultra generation in 2027 — has been delayed by more than 12 months to 2028, because the PCB midplane at the heart of the system remains difficult to manufacture. SemiAnalysis added that NVL576, a larger system linking eight racks via optical connections, is also likely delayed or limited to small volumes. | quote: Nvidia 's next marquee product — the Kyber rack-scale architecture designed to house its 2027 Rubin Ultra chips — has been delayed by more than 12 months to 2028, according to research firm SemiAnalysis, the latest in a string of reported setbacks raising questions about the AI giant's product roadmap. \\\"Kyber NVL144 rack architecture has been delayed to 2028 as the PCB midplane remains challenging from a manufacturability standpoint,\\\" the firm said, referring to a specialized, multi-layer printed circuit board that connects electronic modules within a system. NVL576 — a larger system linking eight racks via optical connections — is also likely delayed or limited to small volumes, the research firm said.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q2\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [third_party_view; SemiAnalysis, reported by CNBC; original source SemiAnalysis, stated Monday] SemiAnalysis reported that Nvidia's backup plan to bolt two current-generation racks together to reach similar compute power was cancelled after cloud service providers and hyperscalers rejected the design as awkward and operationally burdensome, leaving Nvidia, in the firm's words, with \\\"no proven solution to expand the scale-up world size for Rubin Ultra.\\\" | quote: A backup plan — bolting two of Nvidia's current-generation racks together for similar power — has also been scrapped after cloud customers rejected the design as awkward and costly to operate. \\\"It has since been cancelled due to heavy pushback from CSPs [cloud service providers] and hyperscalers over its odd design and heavy operational burden,\\\" SemiAnalysis said. That leaves Nvidia with \\\"no proven solution to expand the scale-up world size for Rubin Ultra,\\\" SemiAnalysis said, predicting that could give rivals Advanced Micro Devices and Google , whose in-house chips are already winning business from top AI labs, a rare technical opening at the high end of the market.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q3\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or