NCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [fact; Bram Berkowitz, fool.com; original source NVIDIA, stated unknown] Nvidia reported that in the first quarter of its fiscal year 2027, the quarter ended April 26, 2026, revenue grew 85% year over year and diluted earnings per share rose 140% year over year, as reported by fool.com's Bram Berkowitz. | quote: In the first quarter of Nvidia's fiscal year 2027, ending April 26, the company grew revenue 85% year over year, while diluted earnings per share soared by 140%.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q9\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original source revises it; another statement on the same topic is not this\"}, \"instructions\": \"How does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [party_statement; Bram Berkowitz, fool.com; original source NVIDIA, stated unknown] Nvidia announced in its first fiscal quarter of 2027 that it plans to become much more involved in the CPU market, and management said it thinks it can generate nearly $20 billion of CPU sales. The item does not state the period over which those sales would be earned. | quote: Furthermore, in its first fiscal quarter of 2027, Nvidia announced plans to become much more involved in the central processing unit (CPU) space , which has been in high demand due to the rise of agentic AI. Management said they think they can generate nearly $20 billion of CPU sales, making it an instant industry leader.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}}, \"state\": \"INCOMING PIECE [party_statement; finance.yahoo.com (Lockridge Okoth, beincrypto.com); original source NVIDIA, stated unknown] Nvidia rejected SemiAnalysis's delay claims, telling media outlets that its roadmap remains intact. | quote: Nvidia rejected the claims, telling media outlets that its roadmap remains intact.\"}",
