 does the INCOMING PIECE relate to the STORED PIECE below? Use only the supplied text. STORED PIECE:\\nSTORED PIECE [party_statement; The Wire China (Noah Berman); original source NVIDIA, stated unknown] Nvidia presented a report to the U.S. government arguing that Huawei's stockpile of AI chips, together with growing capacity at its manufacturing partner SMIC, give Huawei \\\"the flexibility to satisfy global AI chip demand,\\\" and warning that \\\"if Nvidia is kept out of the China market, Huawei production and sales will soar.\\\" The report gave no timeframe and did not address performance differences between Nvidia and Huawei chips. | quote: In a report that Nvidia presented to the U.S. government — which The Wire has reviewed — the company warned that Huawei’s stockpile of chips, along with growing capacity at its manufacturing partner Semiconductor Manufacturing International Corp. (SMIC), give it “the flexibility to satisfy global AI chip demand.” “If Nvidia is kept out of the China market, Huawei production and sales will soar,” the report said, although it did not specify a timeframe or refer to the differences in performance between Nvidia and Huawei chips.\", \"type\": \"choice\"}, \"q8\": {\"criteria\": {\"different\": \"a different fact, figure or matter, a figure for another period or quantity, or only a secondary statement of the stored piece, even if on the same topic\", \"same_statement\": \"the INCOMING PIECE reports the STORED PIECE's main statement: a retelling, another outlet carrying it, the same number in text or a table, or the same speaker repeating it; wording, precision and extra detail may differ. If the stored piece carries several statements and the incoming piece reports only a secondary one, this is not it\", \"supersedes\": \"a later version of the stored piece's main statement, changed: the same speaker revises that guidance, forecast or event-progress statement, an official confirms or denies that reported claim, or the original 